        <mxCell id="text15" value="Valid acceptance continues atomically: use offered price, whole line, same quantity; Snew; Dnew=min(Dold,Snew), F/Q unchanged;&#10;Tnew=Snew−Dnew+F−Q. Read Order.total property, set offer ACCEPTED through data access. COD amount=Tnew; ONLINE state PAID, C&#10;unchanged, refund_amount=C−Tnew. Order stays PLACED (PC04), never auto-confirms. Any conditional 0-row/lock/write/commit failure →&#10;complete rollback†, MG01." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;">
